<title>SWEDEN: Swedish consumer prices fell 0.4 percent in Aug.</title>
<headline>Swedish consumer prices fell 0.4 percent in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish consumer prices fell by 0.4 percent in August, Statistics Sweden said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    SWEDISH CONSUMER PRICES	Aug 96    July 96  Aug 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	  -0.4	-0.2	 -0.1</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	    +0.3	+0.6	 +2.7</p>
<p>Note - Economists polled by Reuters had expected consumer prices to be flat in August for a year on year figure of 0.7 percent.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001017</p>
</text>
